---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Base.astro';

type IconKey = 'washing-machine' | 'dishwasher' | 'oven' | 'dryer' | 'boiler';

const title = 'Appliance Repair in Sofia | In-Home Service by RotoRem';
const description = 'Professional in-home appliance repair in Sofia for washing machines, dryers, dishwashers, ovens, and boilers.';

const serviceColors: Record<IconKey, string> = {
  'washing-machine': 'from-blue-700/80 to-blue-600/80',
  'dishwasher': 'from-emerald-700/80 to-emerald-600/80',
  'oven': 'from-amber-700/80 to-amber-600/80',
  'dryer': 'from-indigo-700/80 to-indigo-600/80',
  'boiler': 'from-teal-700/80 to-teal-600/80',
};

const services = [
  {
    icon: 'washing-machine' as IconKey,
    title: 'Washing Machines',
    description: 'Leaks, spinning issues, noise, pump and electronics repair for all major brands.',
    url: '/en/services/sofia/washing-machine-repair/',
  },
  {
    icon: 'dryer' as IconKey,
    title: 'Dryers',
    description: 'No heat, drum not spinning, sensor and board errors, and preventive maintenance.',
    url: '/en/services/sofia/dryer-repair/',
  },
  {
    icon: 'dishwasher' as IconKey,
    title: 'Dishwashers',
    description: 'Water intake, draining, leak, and control issues fixed on-site in Sofia.',
    url: '/en/services/sofia/dishwasher-repair/',
  },
  {
    icon: 'oven' as IconKey,
    title: 'Ovens & Cooktops',
    description: 'Heating elements, thermostats, sensors, and electrical diagnostics for safe operation.',
    url: '/en/services/sofia/oven-repair/',
  },
  {
    icon: 'boiler' as IconKey,
    title: 'Boilers',
    description: 'Heating element replacement, thermostat repair, leak diagnostics, and descaling.',
    url: '/en/services/sofia/boiler-repair/',
  },
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-primary-dark text-white py-16">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Professional White Goods Repair in Sofia</h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Fast in-home diagnostics and repair for washing machines, dryers, dishwashers, ovens, and boilers.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Visit and diagnostics in Sofia - 30 EUR
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="bg-white text-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg inline-flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
          </svg>
          Send Email
        </a>
        <a href="tel:0898340982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
          Call 089 834 0982
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50 to-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary">Available services in Sofia</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-gray-600">All repairs are performed at your home by experienced technicians.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {services.map((service) => (
          <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow group">
            <div class="absolute inset-0">
              <div class={`absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br ${serviceColors[service.icon]} group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-300`}></div>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10 p-6 h-full flex flex-col text-white">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold drop-shadow-sm">{service.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-white/90 flex-grow">{service.description}</p>
              <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/20">
                <a href={service.url} class="bg-white/30 hover:bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-sm text-white font-medium py-2 px-4 rounded-lg inline-flex items-center transition-colors shadow-sm">
                  Learn more
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SEO Content Section -->
  <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <p dir="ltr">When one of your household appliances stops working, everyday life cannot wait and comfort is quickly affected. Whether it is a washing machine, boiler, or oven, the issue requires a fast response. RotoRem offers appliance repair in Sofia and nearby areas with on-site visits, clear diagnostics, and practical solutions. We cover the entire city and respond at a convenient time for you, without unnecessary delays.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">What appliance repairs we provide in Sofia</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">Every appliance has its own specifics, but faults often start in similar ways: blocking, noise, leaks, no heating, or interrupted programs. Our home appliance service handles both common daily issues and more complex technical cases.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">If you need <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/washing-machine-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">washing machine repair</a> because a cycle does not start or clothes are not cleaned properly, you can rely on fast response and accurate diagnostics. For drying and sensor issues, we provide efficient <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/dryer-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">dryer repair</a>, including professional installation. For leaks or program errors, we offer dependable <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/dishwasher-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">dishwasher repair</a>.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">For homes with hot water issues, we provide <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/boiler-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">boiler repair and maintenance</a>, including descaling. For kitchen appliances, we handle <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/services/sofia/oven-repair/" style="text-decoration:none;">oven and cooker repair</a> when heating is uneven or the appliance stops working.</p>
      <p dir="ltr">We also install new electrical appliances with proper setup, which is essential for long-term reliability. This gives you a complete solution from one home appliance service provider in Sofia, without searching for separate specialists.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Brands we service in Sofia</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We work with a wide range of brands, which allows us to handle many models and technologies. We repair white goods from Bosch, Whirlpool, Samsung, LG, Electrolux, Gorenje, and other established manufacturers. We know their specifics and use suitable components when needed, reducing repeat failures and ensuring more reliable results.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Sofia areas we cover</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">We cover all districts in Sofia and nearby areas up to 20 km. We work in Lyulin, Druzhba, Nadezhda, Ovcha Kupel, Manastirski Livadi, Lozenets, City Center, Studentski Grad, and more. We also provide appliance repair in Mladost with fast response and flexible booking hours. Wherever you are, you can rely on timely service.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">How white goods repair works</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">The process starts with an on-site visit and diagnostic check. The goal is to find the exact cause, not to guess. You then receive a clear offer with a specific repair price. Once approved, we proceed with the repair using proper tools and parts. Finally, we test the appliance to confirm normal operation. This gives you a working solution without unnecessary costs or delays.</p>
      <h2 dir="ltr">Why choose RotoRem home appliance service</h2>
      <p dir="ltr">Customers choose our service when they want reliability and clear terms. Our experience enables fast response and accurate diagnostics. We work on-site, saving time and transport effort. Every white goods repair includes warranty, and prices are agreed in advance. We service all popular brands and approach every case individually. Our goal is a long-term solution, not a temporary fix. Contact us now and book a convenient visit. Send an inquiry or <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/en/contact/" style="text-decoration:none;">contact us</a> to arrange your appointment.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>


